  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MK SEPA Scoping mission</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MK SEPA Scoping mission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Naturv&#xe5;rdsverket unders&#xf6;ker m&#xf6;jligheter och utformning av bilateralt samarbete inom milj&#xf6;omr&#xe5;det i Makedonien. Huvudsaklig samarbetspart &#xe4;r milj&#xf6;ministeriet i Skopje, men &#xe4;ven andra relevanta partners kommer att involveras. En inledande fas, d&#xe4;r problemformulering, f&#xf6;rslag till samarbetsomr&#xe5;den och arbetss&#xe4;tt diskuteras med samarbetspartners i Makedonien, &#xe4;ger rum under 2018. Resultatet av denna fas ligger sedan till grund f&#xf6;r beslut om eventuellt fortsatt bilateralt samarbete.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Environmental Protection Agency (SEPA) is undertaking a scoping mission to Macedonia to investigate opportunities for a bilateral cooperation within the area of environment. The main counterpart is the Ministry of Environment in Skopje, but also other relevant partners will be involved. The scoping mission to be undertaken during 2018 will identify and review possible areas for cooperation as well as cooperation modalities. The result of this first phase will be the basis for the decision on a possible continued bilateral cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
